(DECOUPLING / BYPASS CAPACITOR NOTES:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. ALL 0.1uF AND 1uF DECOUPLING CAPACITORS MUST BE PLACED ) Tj
T* (AS CLOSE AS PHYSICALLY POSSIBLE TO THEIR RESPECTIVE IC POWER ) Tj
T* (PINS WITH SHORT TRACES TO A SOLID GROUND PLANE.) Tj
T* (2. PREFER 0402/0603 SURFACE-MOUNT CERAMIC CAPACITORS ) Tj
T* (\(X7R DIELECTRIC\) WITH DIRECT VIA-TO-GROUND CONNECTIONS ) Tj
T* (AT THE PAD.) Tj
ET
7.20 w
BT
/F2 6.092307692307692 Tf
7.92 TL
0.000 g
89.64 302.98 Td
(U42 is the fixed 3.3V output variant \(TPS63001\). ) Tj
T* (Pin 10 \(FB\) must be tied directly to Pin 1 \(VOUT\) without an external resistor divider.) Tj
T* (Pin 6 \(EN\) and Pin 7 \(PS/SYNC\) are connected to VINA \(filtered input\).  PS/SYNC tied HIGH disables power-save mode, forcing constant-frequency PWM operation to minimize audio-band ripple.) Tj
T* (R35 \(100 Ohm\) and C54 \(100nF\) form an RC filter for the analog control pin VINA \(Pin 8\). ) Tj
T* (C54 must be placed as close as possible to Pin 8 and returned to Pin 9 \(GND\).) Tj
T* (C53 \(10uF\) serves as input bulk storage. ) Tj
T* (C52 \(10uF\) and C51 \(10uF\) serve as parallel output bulk capacitors to minimize ripple under load. ) Tj
T* (All ceramics should be rated >= 10V \(X7R or X5R\) to minimize DC-bias capacitance loss at 3.3V.) Tj
T* (L4. 2.2uH shielded power inductor. Must have a saturation current \(Isat\) rating of >= 2.0A to handle peak switching currents without core saturation.) Tj
T* (L5. Master ferrite bead \(BLM18PG121SN1D, 120 Ohm @ 100MHz, 2A\) isolates the 1.5MHz switching noise of the buck-boost from downstream digital/audio rails.) Tj
T* (PGND Pin 3 and Thermal Pad 11. Power Ground handling high switching currents. ) Tj
T* (Input cap C53 and output caps \(C51, C52\) MUST return directly to PGND.) Tj
T* (GND \(Pin 9\): Control/Logic Ground. PGND and GND are connected at a single star-point right at the thermal pad Pin 11 / Pin 9 on the PCB.) Tj
T* (Pin 11 \(Exposed Thermal Pad\) must be soldered directly to the ground copper pour with multiple thermal vias for heat dissipation.) Tj
T* (Keep trace loops from Pin 5 \(VIN\) -> C53 -> Pin 3 \(PGND\), and Pin 1 \(VOUT\) -> C52/C51 -> Pin 3 \(PGND\) as short and wide as possible to prevent EMI and stability issues.) Tj
ET
7.20 w
BT
/F2 4.430769230769231 Tf
5.76 TL
0.000 g
471.24 539.14 Td
(TDM, PDM, TSDP chip config details. ) Tj
T* (8 channels, 32 bits, 24 ksamples/sec audio rate) Tj
T* (SCLK = 32*8*24k=6.144MHz.) Tj
T* (LRCLK =one pulse of SCLK every 1/24000 seconds) Tj
T* (SCLK/LRCLK=256) Tj
T* (PDM clock=3.072MHz. Infineon mic has highest SNR there.) Tj
T* (==>OSR=3.072MHz/24kHz=128.) Tj
T* (TDM=>1,1 for 2CH_TDM1,2) Tj
T* (32bits=>0,0 for WL_MSB,_LSB) Tj
T* (FS=24kHz,SCLK/LRCLK=256,OSR=128=>1,1,0 for OS_MODE3,2,1) Tj
ET
Q
endstream
endobj
